msgid ""
"**Upgrade to server version v10.11.0 or later is required.** Support for "
"server [Extended Support Release](https://docs.mattermost.com/product-"
"overview/release-policy.html#extended-support-releases) (ESR) v10.5.0 has"
" ended and upgrading to server ESR v10.11.0 or later is required. As we "
"innovate and offer newer versions of our mobile apps, we maintain "
"backwards compatibility only with supported server versions. Users who "
"upgrade to the newest mobile apps while being connected to an unsupported"
" server version can be exposed to compatibility issues, which can cause "
"crashes or severe bugs that break core functionality of the app."
msgstr ""

