msgid "Improvements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:24
msgid ""
"Added [mobile support](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/send-messages.html) for AI agents including a dedicated"
" agent chat interface, threads list view, and bot selector with profile "
"pictures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:25
msgid ""
"**Share feedback** from in-app prompts now opens the Mattermost community"
" forum in the browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:26
msgid "Channel banners are now shown in thread views."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:27
msgid "Added the ability to set shared channels from the channel settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:28
msgid ""
"Tapping the [team name](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/organize-using-teams.html) in the channel list header "
"now opens a bottom-sheet menu where users can join another team or leave "
"the current team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:29
msgid ""
"Mobile apps now support multiselect, dynamic search, multi-step dialogs, "
"and dynamic field refresh for Interactive Dialogs, bringing feature "
"parity with the web app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:30
msgid ""
"The pre-auth secret header name is now always retrieved in lowercase to "
"support HTTP1.1."
msgstr ""

