#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:33
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where opening a permalink to a channel the user was not a "
"member of showed a \"Message not viewable\" error instead of prompting to"
" join the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:34
msgid ""
"Fixed native crashes during Hermes garbage collection in the gallery "
"pager and lightbox components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:35
msgid ""
"Fixed the display height for file upload errors in low bandwidth settings"
" on iOS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:36
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash on Android where React Native Navigation could attempt to "
"bring a destroyed controller to the front during activity teardown "
"(Sentry AX68, 9,150 crashes, 1,580 users)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:37
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on Android where GIF file attachments did not animate for "
"users other than the uploader."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:38
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in the iOS app caused by concurrent database access between"
" the main app and push notification extension."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:39
msgid "Fixed an issue showing wrong search results on hashtag tapping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:40
msgid "Fixed search results layout overlap on hashtag tapping on Android."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:41
msgid "Fixed a race condition on websocket messages on iOS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:42
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on iOS where permalink thread headers were so long that "
"channel names truncated instead of overlapped the title on mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:43
msgid ""
"Fixed issue with keyboard stuck after opening from a push notification on"
" iOS."
msgstr ""

