#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:1746
msgid ""
"Mattermost mobile v2.0 is a major update to the iOS and Android apps "
"bringing support for multiple workspaces and a more stable and performant"
" user experience that includes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:1748
msgid ""
"Support for collaborating in multiple workspaces with a redesigned "
"channel and team sidebar for easier navigation."
