msgid ""
"Improved app responsiveness to user input, faster launch, and less memory"
" consumed when running."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:1750
msgid ""
"Improved app stability so users encounter fewer crashes and bugs, as well"
" as reduced app hang and errors if internet connectivity becomes "
"unstable."
