#: ../../source/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog.md:1773
msgid ""
"Mobile App v1.55.1 is our first extended support release (ESR). We are "
"very excited about the upcoming general availability of the v2.0 mobile "
"app in December. We recognize that some customers may have a custom build"
" of Mattermost mobile and need more time to test or implement their "
"custom changes on mobile v2.0. The mobile ESR will be supported until "
"July 2023. v1.55.1 will receive critical security fixes only and will be "
"released as needed via unsigned builds to our mobile GitHub repository."
